From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp140: Implement _Hard_links, _Statvfs, _Chmod and _Symlink_get.

msvcp140's experimental filesystem helpers, with the contracts the
public <experimental/filesystem> header gives them: _Hard_links (the
link count, -1 on error), _Statvfs (the volume's capacity, free and
available space; all -1 on error, as std::filesystem::space reports
errors), _Chmod (the read-only attribute: read-only without a write
permission; 0 on success) and _Symlink_get (the text of a symbolic link
or mount point, empty when there is none). msvcp_win forwards.
